ASP.NET Core 提供了多种性能优化技术，从响应缓存到编译优化，可以显著提升应用性能。

## 响应缓存

**内存缓存（IMemoryCache）**：
```csharp
builder.Services.AddMemoryCache();

public class ProductService
{
    private readonly IMemoryCache _cache;

    public ProductService(IMemoryCache cache)
    {
        _cache = cache;
    }

    public Product GetProduct(int id)
    {
        return _cache.GetOrCreate($"product_{id}", entry =>
        {
            entry.AbsoluteExpirationRelativeToNow = TimeSpan.FromMinutes(10);
            return _repository.GetById(id);
        });
    }
}
```

**分布式缓存（IDistributedCache）**：
```csharp
// Redis 缓存
builder.Services.AddStackExchangeRedisCache(options =>
{
    options.Configuration = "localhost:6379";
    options.InstanceName = "myapp_";
});

// 使用
public class CacheService
{
    private readonly IDistributedCache _cache;

    public async Task<string> GetValueAsync(string key)
    {
        var value = await _cache.GetStringAsync(key);
        if (value == null)
        {
            value = await GetValueFromDbAsync();
            await _cache.SetStringAsync(key, value,
                new DistributedCacheEntryOptions
                {
                    AbsoluteExpirationRelativeToNow = TimeSpan.FromHours(1)
                });
        }
        return value;
    }
}
```

**响应缓存中间件**：
```csharp
builder.Services.AddResponseCaching();

app.UseResponseCaching();

[ResponseCache(Duration = 60, VaryByQueryKeys = new[] { "page" })]
public IActionResult GetProducts(int page)
{
    // 响应会被缓存 60 秒
}
```

## 响应压缩

```csharp
builder.Services.AddResponseCompression(options =>
{
    options.EnableForHttps = true;
    options.Providers.Add<BrotliCompressionProvider>();
    options.Providers.Add<GzipCompressionProvider>();
});

app.UseResponseCompression();
```

## 最小 API

.NET 6 引入的轻量级 API 开发方式：
```csharp
var app = builder.Build();

app.MapGet("/", () => "Hello World!");

app.MapGet("/users/{id}", async (int id, IUserService service) =>
{
    var user = await service.GetById(id);
    return user is not null ? Results.Ok(user) : Results.NotFound();
});

app.MapPost("/users", async (User user, IUserService service) =>
{
    await service.Create(user);
    return Results.Created($"/users/{user.Id}", user);
});
```

**参数绑定**：
```csharp
app.MapGet("/search", (string keyword, int page = 1) =>
{
    return Results.Ok(new { keyword, page });
});

app.MapPost("/upload", async (IFormFile file) =>
{
    // 文件上传
});
```

**过滤器**：
```csharp
app.MapGet("/protected", () => "Secret")
    .RequireAuthorization();

app.MapGet("/cached", () => "Cached")
    .WithMetadata(new ResponseCacheAttribute(Duration = 60));
```

## AOT 编译

.NET 7+ 支持的 Ahead-of-Time 编译：
```xml
<PropertyGroup>
    <PublishAot>true</PublishAot>
</PropertyGroup>
```

**AOT 优点**：
- 启动时间快
- 内存占用小
- 无需安装运行时
- 更好的安全性

**AOT 限制**：
- 不支持动态加载
- 反射受限
- 文件体积可能较大
- 编译时间长

## 性能优化最佳实践

**1. 数据库优化**：
```csharp
// 使用 AsNoTracking
var users = await _context.Users
    .AsNoTracking()
    .Where(u => u.IsActive)
    .ToListAsync();

// 使用投影
var userDtos = await _context.Users
    .Select(u => new UserDto { Id = u.Id, Name = u.Name })
    .ToListAsync();
```

**2. 异步编程**：
```csharp
// 避免阻塞
public async Task<IActionResult> GetData()
{
    var data = await _service.GetDataAsync(); // 异步
    return Ok(data);
}
```

**3. 对象池**：
```csharp
builder.Services.AddSingleton<ObjectPool<HttpClient>>(provider =>
{
    var policy = new DefaultPooledObjectPolicy<HttpClient>();
    return new DefaultObjectPool<HttpClient>(policy);
});
```

**4. 预编译查询**：
```csharp
private static readonly Func<MyDbContext, int, User> GetUserById =
    EF.CompileQuery((MyDbContext context, int id) =>
        context.Users.FirstOrDefault(u => u.Id == id));
```

**5. 使用 ValueTask**：
```csharp
public ValueTask<int> GetCachedValueAsync(int key)
{
    if (_cache.TryGetValue(key, out var value))
        return new ValueTask<int>(value);

    return new ValueTask<int>(GetValueFromDbAsync(key));
}
```

## 性能监控

**Application Insights**：
```csharp
builder.Services.AddApplicationInsightsTelemetry();
```

**自定义计时**：
```csharp
app.Use(async (context, next) =>
{
    var stopwatch = Stopwatch.StartNew();
    await next();
    stopwatch.Stop();

